{"id":"u01","kelas":7,"no":1,"judul":"Menyapa dan Memperkenalkan Diri","title":"Hello!","emoji":"👋","ringkas":"Greetings, nama, umur, asal, kabar, dan mengeja nama","ready":true,"goals":["menyapa orang dengan tepat sesuai waktu: [[Good morning]], [[Good afternoon]], [[Good evening]]","memperkenalkan diri: nama, umur, dan asal","menanyakan dan menjawab kabar dengan [[How are you?]]","mengeja nama dengan huruf Inggris","bersikap sopan: [[please]], [[thank you]], [[sorry]], [[excuse me]]"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Selamat datang di **Unit 1**! 🎉 Di sini kamu belajar hal pertama yang dilakukan saat bertemu orang baru: **menyapa dan berkenalan**. Klik kata Inggris yang berwarna, seperti [[Hello]], untuk mendengar cara membacanya."},{"t":"vocab","title":"1. Menyapa dan berpamitan (Greetings)","items":[{"en":"Hello","id":"Halo","ex":"Hello, Rani!"},{"en":"Hi","id":"Hai (lebih santai)","ex":"Hi, Budi!"},{"en":"Good morning","id":"Selamat pagi","ex":"Good morning, Miss Sari."},{"en":"Good afternoon","id":"Selamat siang / sore","ex":"Good afternoon, everyone."},{"en":"Good evening","id":"Selamat malam (saat bertemu)","ex":"Good evening, Mr. Adi."},{"en":"Good night","id":"Selamat malam (saat pamit / mau tidur)","ex":"Good night, Mom."},{"en":"Goodbye","id":"Selamat tinggal / sampai jumpa","ex":"Goodbye, class."},{"en":"Bye","id":"Dah (lebih santai)","ex":"Bye, see you!"},{"en":"See you tomorrow","id":"Sampai jumpa besok","ex":"Bye! See you tomorrow."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"Kapan memakai Good morning, afternoon, evening, dan night?","text":"Sapaan berubah mengikuti **waktu**. Perhatikan tabel ini:","table":[["Sapaan","Kira-kira jam","Dipakai untuk"],["[[Good morning]]","pagi sampai sekitar 12.00","menyapa saat bertemu"],["[[Good afternoon]]","sekitar 12.00 sampai 18.00","menyapa saat bertemu"],["[[Good evening]]","setelah sekitar 18.00","menyapa saat bertemu"],["[[Good night]]","malam hari","**berpisah** atau mau tidur"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Good night bukan untuk menyapa","text":"Orang Indonesia sering bilang \"selamat malam\" saat bertemu. Dalam bahasa Inggris, saat **bertemu** malam hari pakai [[Good evening]]. [[Good night]] hanya dipakai saat **pamit** atau **mau tidur**."},{"t":"vocab","title":"2. Kata sopan santun","items":[{"en":"Please","id":"Tolong / silakan","ex":"Open the door, please."},{"en":"Thank you","id":"Terima kasih","ex":"Thank you, Dina!"},{"en":"Thanks","id":"Makasih (santai)","ex":"Thanks a lot!"},{"en":"You're welcome","id":"Sama-sama","ex":"A: Thank you. B: You're welcome."},{"en":"Sorry","id":"Maaf (karena salah)","ex":"Sorry, I'm late."},{"en":"Excuse me","id":"Permisi / maaf mengganggu","ex":"Excuse me, Sir."},{"en":"Pardon?","id":"Maaf, apa? (minta diulang)","ex":"Pardon? Can you repeat that?"}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 1: Pagi di sekolah","lines":[{"who":"Rani","en":"Good morning, Budi!","id":"Selamat pagi, Budi!"},{"who":"Budi","en":"Good morning, Rani! How are you?","id":"Selamat pagi, Rani! Apa kabar?"},{"who":"Rani","en":"I'm fine, thank you. And you?","id":"Aku baik, terima kasih. Kamu?"},{"who":"Budi","en":"I'm great, thanks!","id":"Aku sangat baik, makasih!"},{"who":"Rani","en":"See you in class!","id":"Sampai jumpa di kelas!"}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. Menanyakan dan menjawab kabar","text":"Pertanyaan: [[How are you?]] (Apa kabar?)\nBiasanya kita menjawab, lalu bertanya balik dengan [[And you?]] (Kamu?). Itu tanda sopan.","table":[["Jawaban","Artinya"],["[[I'm great.]] / [[I'm fine.]]","Aku baik 😊"],["[[I'm good.]]","Aku baik"],["[[I'm okay.]] / [[Not bad.]]","Lumayan / biasa saja 😐"],["[[I'm tired.]]","Aku capek 😴"],["[[I'm sick.]]","Aku sakit 🤒"]],"examples":[{"en":"[[How are you?]] — [[I'm fine, thank you. And you?]]","id":"Apa kabar? — Baik, terima kasih. Kamu?"}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Memperkenalkan diri","text":"Pakai pola kalimat ini. Ganti bagian yang bercetak tebal dengan datamu sendiri.","table":[["Pola","Contoh","Artinya"],["My name is **(nama)**.","[[My name is Rani.]]","Namaku Rani."],["I am **(nama)**.","[[I am Rani.]] / [[I'm Rani.]]","Aku Rani."],["I am **(angka)** years old.","[[I am twelve years old.]]","Umurku dua belas tahun."],["I am from **(tempat)**.","[[I am from Bandung.]]","Aku berasal dari Bandung."],["Nice to meet you.","[[Nice to meet you.]]","Senang bertemu denganmu."]],"examples":[{"en":"[[Nice to meet you.]] — [[Nice to meet you, too.]]","id":"Senang bertemu denganmu. — Aku juga senang bertemu denganmu."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"I am = I'm","text":"Dalam percakapan, **I am** biasanya disingkat menjadi **I'm**. Artinya sama. Jadi [[I'm twelve years old.]] sama dengan [[I am twelve years old.]]"},{"t":"warn","title":"Umur tidak memakai \"have\"","text":"Dalam bahasa Indonesia kita bilang \"aku **punya** umur…\"? Tidak, kan. Dalam bahasa Inggris juga tidak pakai *have*. Yang benar: [[I am twelve years old.]] Bukan *I have twelve years old*."},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Tiga pertanyaan penting","text":"Saat berkenalan, ada tiga pertanyaan yang paling sering muncul.","table":[["Pertanyaan","Artinya","Contoh jawaban"],["[[What's your name?]]","Siapa namamu?","My name is Dina."],["[[How old are you?]]","Berapa umurmu?","I'm twelve."],["[[Where are you from?]]","Kamu berasal dari mana?","I'm from Bandung."]],"examples":[{"en":"**What's** = What is","id":"What's your name? = What is your name?"}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 2: Berkenalan","lines":[{"who":"Dina","en":"Hello! My name is Dina. What's your name?","id":"Halo! Namaku Dina. Siapa namamu?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"Hi, Dina. I'm Tom. Nice to meet you.","id":"Hai, Dina. Aku Tom. Senang bertemu denganmu."},{"who":"Dina","en":"Nice to meet you, too. Where are you from?","id":"Aku juga senang bertemu denganmu. Kamu berasal dari mana?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"I'm from Australia. How about you?","id":"Aku dari Australia. Kalau kamu?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"I'm from Indonesia. I'm twelve years old.","id":"Aku dari Indonesia. Umurku dua belas tahun."},{"who":"Tom","en":"I'm twelve, too!","id":"Aku juga dua belas!"}]},{"t":"alphabet","title":"6. Huruf-huruf bahasa Inggris (klik untuk mendengar)","letters":[["A","ei"],["B","bi"],["C","si"],["D","di"],["E","i"],["F","ef"],["G","ji"],["H","eich"],["I","ai"],["J","jei"],["K","kei"],["L","el"],["M","em"],["N","en"],["O","ou"],["P","pi"],["Q","kyu"],["R","ar"],["S","es"],["T","ti"],["U","yu"],["V","vi"],["W","dabel-yu"],["X","eks"],["Y","wai"],["Z","zed / zi"]]},{"t":"p","text":"Untuk mengeja namamu, tanyakan [[How do you spell your name?]] (Bagaimana mengeja namamu?). Jawabannya huruf demi huruf: [[R, A, N, I.]]"},{"t":"tip","title":"Huruf yang sering tertukar","text":"Hati-hati dengan **E** dibaca \"i\", **I** dibaca \"ai\", dan **G** dibaca \"ji\". Berbeda dengan huruf Indonesia, ya!"},{"t":"summary","items":["Sapaan: [[Good morning]] (pagi), [[Good afternoon]] (siang/sore), [[Good evening]] (malam, saat bertemu), [[Good night]] (pamit atau tidur).","Kabar: [[How are you?]] → [[I'm fine, thank you. And you?]]","Berkenalan: [[My name is …]], [[I am … years old]], [[I am from …]], [[Nice to meet you.]]","Umur tidak memakai *have*: [[I am twelve years old.]]","Sopan: [[please]], [[thank you]] → [[You're welcome]], [[sorry]], [[excuse me]]."]}],"practice":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Sekarang pukul 09.00 pagi. Kamu bertemu gurumu. Apa sapaannya?","options":["Good morning","Good afternoon","Good evening","Good night"],"answer":0,"exp":"Pagi sampai sekitar jam 12.00 memakai Good morning.","k":"1a1de42c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Sekarang pukul 15.00. Kamu menyapa temanmu. Apa sapaannya?","options":["Good morning","Good afternoon","Good evening","Good night"],"answer":1,"exp":"Siang sampai sore (sekitar 12.00–18.00) memakai Good afternoon.","k":"a2f162ba"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pukul 19.00 kamu bertemu tetanggamu. Apa sapaannya?","options":["Good night","Good morning","Good evening","Good afternoon"],"answer":2,"exp":"Saat BERTEMU di malam hari pakai Good evening. Good night bukan sapaan.","k":"7fb211fe"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kamu mau tidur dan berpamitan kepada ibumu. Apa yang kamu ucapkan?","options":["Good morning, Mom.","Good night, Mom.","Good afternoon, Mom.","Nice to meet you, Mom."],"answer":1,"exp":"Good night dipakai saat pamit atau mau tidur.","k":"5a99a96d"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["Thank you","Terima kasih"],["Sorry","Maaf"],["Please","Tolong"],["Goodbye","Sampai jumpa"],["Excuse me","Permisi"]],"exp":"Kata-kata sopan ini sangat sering dipakai. Hafalkan ya!","k":"4cd7b94a"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan, lalu pilih artinya.","say":"Nice to meet you","options":["Senang bertemu denganmu","Sampai jumpa besok","Apa kabar?","Terima kasih"],"answer":0,"exp":"Nice to meet you = senang bertemu denganmu.","k":"9fba73f8"},{"type":"fill","id":"Namaku Rani.","q":"My ___ is Rani.","answers":["name"],"hint":"Nama dalam bahasa Inggris","exp":"My name is … untuk menyebut namamu.","k":"4a5a3f00"},{"type":"fill","id":"Umurku dua belas tahun.","q":"I ___ twelve years old.","answers":["am"],"hint":"I … (to be)","exp":"Bersama I, kita pakai am. Boleh juga disingkat I'm.","k":"f78ac84c"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Namaku Budi.\"","answer":"My name is Budi.","exp":"Urutan: My name is + nama.","k":"37a1f957"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Aku berasal dari Indonesia.\"","answer":"I am from Indonesia.","exp":"Pola: I am from + tempat.","k":"e35c7bec"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Temanmu bertanya: \"How are you?\" Jawaban yang paling tepat?","options":["I'm fine, thank you. And you?","My name is Dina.","I'm twelve years old.","I'm from Bandung."],"answer":0,"exp":"How are you? menanyakan kabar, jadi jawab dengan kabar.","k":"65d66e22"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jawaban yang tepat untuk \"What's your name?\" adalah...","options":["I'm fine.","My name is Sari.","I'm twelve.","Nice to meet you."],"answer":1,"exp":"What's your name? = Siapa namamu? Jawab dengan My name is …","k":"01675c58"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara yang benar untuk menyebut umur adalah...","options":["I have twelve years old.","I am twelve years old.","My age twelve.","I twelve years old."],"answer":1,"exp":"Umur memakai I am … years old, bukan have.","k":"c9f40a76"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan ejaannya. Siapa namanya?","say":"B, U, D, I","options":["Budi","Dodi","Bobi","Rudi"],"answer":0,"exp":"B-U-D-I dibaca bi-yu-di-ai = BUDI.","k":"debb3315"},{"type":"fill","id":"Terima kasih. — Sama-sama.","q":"Thank you. — You're ___.","answers":["welcome"],"hint":"w _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"You're welcome adalah balasan untuk thank you.","k":"cf9a4917"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"Excuse me\"?","options":["Maaf, aku salah","Permisi / maaf mengganggu","Terima kasih banyak","Sampai jumpa"],"answer":1,"exp":"Excuse me untuk menarik perhatian atau lewat dengan sopan. Sorry untuk meminta maaf karena salah.","k":"34a6def5"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan sapaan dengan waktunya:","pairs":[["Good morning","pukul 08.00 pagi"],["Good afternoon","pukul 14.00 siang"],["Good evening","pukul 19.00 malam"],["Good night","mau tidur"]],"exp":"Setiap sapaan punya waktunya sendiri.","k":"d05f08b3"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan ungkapan dengan artinya:","pairs":[["Hello","Halo"],["Goodbye","Sampai jumpa"],["See you tomorrow","Sampai jumpa besok"],["Nice to meet you","Senang bertemu denganmu"]],"exp":"Sapaan dan perpisahan dasar.","k":"5bd57e5a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teman barumu berkata \"Nice to meet you.\" Jawaban yang tepat adalah...","options":["Nice to meet you, too.","I'm twelve.","Good night.","Thank you very much."],"answer":0,"exp":"Balas dengan Nice to meet you, too.","k":"8efac3df"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kamu menabrak seseorang tanpa sengaja. Kamu bilang...","options":["Sorry!","Good morning!","You're welcome!","See you!"],"answer":0,"exp":"Sorry untuk meminta maaf.","k":"0f29c9c6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kamu ingin lewat di antara orang-orang yang berdiri. Kamu bilang...","options":["Excuse me.","Good night.","I'm fine.","Nice to meet you."],"answer":0,"exp":"Excuse me = permisi.","k":"ebc275b5"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Temanmu memberimu pensil. Kamu bilang...","options":["Thank you!","Sorry!","Excuse me!","Goodbye!"],"answer":0,"exp":"Thank you = terima kasih.","k":"175fc5dd"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang benar?","options":["My name is Dina.","My name Dina.","I name is Dina.","Name my is Dina."],"answer":0,"exp":"Pola: My name is + nama.","k":"1170f377"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang benar?","options":["I am from Bandung.","I from Bandung.","I are from Bandung.","I is from Bandung."],"answer":0,"exp":"I am from + tempat.","k":"3c8cbba0"},{"type":"fill","id":"Namaku Budi.","q":"My name ___ Budi.","answers":["is"],"hint":"am / is / are ?","exp":"My name is Budi.","k":"5d6127b6"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku berumur dua belas tahun.","q":"I am twelve ___ old.","answers":["years"],"hint":"y _ _ _ _","exp":"years old = tahun (umur).","k":"16ea829b"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku baik-baik saja, terima kasih.","q":"I'm ___, thank you.","answers":["fine","good","great","okay"],"hint":"f _ _ _","exp":"Jawaban untuk How are you?","k":"af5defc2"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Senang bertemu denganmu.\"","answer":"Nice to meet you.","exp":"Nice to meet you.","k":"ded8a52f"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun pertanyaan: \"Siapa namamu?\"","answer":"What's your name?","exp":"What's your name?","k":"732163d9"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Aku berasal dari Jakarta.\"","answer":"I am from Jakarta.","exp":"I am from + tempat.","k":"0aef2cc7"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa sapaannya?","say":"Good afternoon","options":["Selamat siang","Selamat pagi","Selamat malam","Selamat tinggal"],"answer":0,"exp":"afternoon = siang / sore.","k":"9342bb20"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa pertanyaannya?","say":"How old are you","options":["Berapa umurmu?","Siapa namamu?","Dari mana kamu?","Apa kabar?"],"answer":0,"exp":"How old = berapa umur.","k":"7f34f4b7"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan ejaannya. Siapa namanya?","say":"D, I, N, A","options":["Dina","Dini","Dana","Dian"],"answer":0,"exp":"D-I-N-A = Dina.","k":"7d431a61"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"Hello! My name is Sari. I am twelve years old. I am from Medan.\" Dari mana Sari berasal?","options":["Medan","Bandung","Jakarta","Surabaya"],"answer":0,"exp":"I am from Medan.","k":"7395b976"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"Hi, I'm Tom. I'm from Australia. I'm thirteen.\" Berapa umur Tom?","options":["Tiga belas","Dua belas","Tiga puluh","Sebelas"],"answer":0,"exp":"I'm thirteen.","k":"a7ccdb5f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"Good morning!\" B: \"Good morning! How are you?\" A: \"___\" Jawaban A yang tepat adalah...","options":["I'm fine, thank you. And you?","My name is Budi.","I'm twelve years old.","Goodbye."],"answer":0,"exp":"Menjawab How are you?","k":"9aa1fc1b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"Nice to meet you.\" B: \"___\" Jawaban B yang tepat adalah...","options":["Nice to meet you, too.","I'm sorry.","Good night.","You're welcome."],"answer":0,"exp":"Balasan perkenalan.","k":"f5e23205"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"Thank you for your help.\" B: \"___\" Jawaban B yang tepat adalah...","options":["You're welcome.","Nice to meet you.","Good morning.","I'm from Bali."],"answer":0,"exp":"Balasan thank you.","k":"c0c6793f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["I have twelve years old.","I am twelve years old.","I'm twelve years old.","I am twelve."],"answer":0,"exp":"Umur memakai am, bukan have.","k":"81dec620"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["Good night, Mr. Adi. (saat bertemu pukul 8 malam)","Good evening, Mr. Adi. (saat bertemu pukul 8 malam)","Good morning, Mr. Adi. (pukul 7 pagi)","Good afternoon, Mr. Adi. (pukul 2 siang)"],"answer":0,"exp":"Saat bertemu malam: Good evening.","k":"a17fd5f8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["My name Rani.","My name is Rani.","I am Rani.","I'm Rani."],"answer":0,"exp":"Kurang is.","k":"b32f211e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Senang berkenalan denganmu\" dalam bahasa Inggris adalah...","options":["Nice to meet you.","Nice to see you yesterday.","Good to eat you.","Nice name."],"answer":0,"exp":"Nice to meet you.","k":"a59c00ca"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Apa kabar?\" dalam bahasa Inggris adalah...","options":["How are you?","What are you?","Who are you?","Where are you?"],"answer":0,"exp":"How are you?","k":"4d413b4c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang BUKAN pertanyaan perkenalan?","options":["Thank you very much.","What's your name?","How old are you?","Where are you from?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Thank you adalah ucapan terima kasih.","k":"79163941"},{"type":"fill","id":"Selamat tinggal, sampai jumpa besok.","q":"Goodbye, see you ___.","answers":["tomorrow"],"hint":"t _ _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"tomorrow = besok.","k":"9c346457"},{"type":"fill","id":"Maaf, aku terlambat.","q":"___, I'm late.","answers":["sorry"],"hint":"s _ _ _ _","exp":"Sorry = maaf.","k":"359d4afa"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tolong bantu aku.","q":"Help me, ___.","answers":["please"],"hint":"p _ _ _ _ _","exp":"please = tolong.","k":"e6cff9dc"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia berasal dari Bali.","q":"She ___ from Bali.","answers":["is"],"hint":"am / is / are ?","exp":"She → is.","k":"3ca6a078"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Selamat pagi, Bu Sari.\"","answer":"Good morning, Miss Sari.","exp":"Good morning, + nama.","k":"56f07c3a"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Namanya Dina dan dia berumur dua belas.\"","answer":"Her name is Dina and she is twelve.","exp":"Her name is ... and she is ...","k":"46f6aa01"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan percakapan. Apa balasannya?","say":"I'm fine thank you","options":["Aku baik, terima kasih","Namaku Dina","Aku berumur dua belas","Sampai jumpa"],"answer":0,"exp":"Jawaban untuk How are you?","k":"e8e79ffb"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"See you later","options":["Sampai jumpa lagi","Selamat pagi","Terima kasih","Permisi"],"answer":0,"exp":"See you later = sampai jump